without expecting anything in return.

11
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:37,650
Watching him do
what he loves from afar

12
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:39,020
is enough to make me happy.

13
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:41,780
To Nine,

14
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,410
the highly skilled actor

15
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:46,250
whom I regard as the light of my life:

16
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:49,670
Your existence

17
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:51,880
makes me truly happy.

18
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,990
For that reason...
please live such a happy, happy life.

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,700
From this fanboy of yours!

20
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:02,200
[Mr. Fanboy Series]

21
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,440
Wan, where are you?

22
00:01:05,459 --> 00:01:08,170
They're already strutting so much
they might as well do next year's lineup.

23
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:10,270
Tell them to catch up with
this year's plan first.

24
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,990
Nine hasn't arrived, has he?

25
00:01:12,270 --> 00:01:13,039
Not yet.

26
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,640
But I think he'll be here any minute now.

27
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:15,750
Get a move on!

28
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,100
Okay, okay.

29
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,150
I'm hanging up now.

30
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:44,810
And here they are, the pair of lead actors

31
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:47,770
from 'Friend Benefit'!

32
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,740
- Hello.
- Hello.

33
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:49,950
- Hello, hello.
- Hello.

34
00:01:49,979 --> 00:01:50,470
Hello, there.

35
00:01:50,490 --> 00:01:52,530
Alright, please introduce yourselves.

36
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:54,100
Who do you play in this series?

37
00:01:54,130 --> 00:01:55,300
I play Jai.

38
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:56,530
What about you, sweetie?

39
00:01:56,630 --> 00:01:57,610
My character's name is Pik.

40
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,360
Pik.

41
00:01:58,410 --> 00:01:59,650
Every pairing on our red carpet

42
00:01:59,690 --> 00:02:01,420
is marvelous today.

43
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:11,830
Next up, let's hear it
from another project we have,

44
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,730
'UNKNOWN LOVER'!

45
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:14,990
Hello there.

46
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:17,020
International fans,
don't miss it for the world.

47
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:18,690
Yes, for all international fans,

48
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:20,970
please be kind, and also, please welcome

49
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:22,270
our new series project

50
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:23,850
because we can't wait to see

51
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,110
the 'UNKNOWN LOVER' pilot.

52
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,260
- 'Friend Benefit.'
- It's 'Friend Benefit.'

53
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:27,250
There.

54
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,180
- In Thai, it's "Just friends."
- In Thai, it's "Just friends."

55
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:29,650
Just friends, huh?

56
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:30,940
That's all?

57
00:02:30,970 --> 00:02:31,760
Pinky swear?

58
00:02:55,930 --> 00:02:57,350
Wan, damn it, come here!

59
00:02:58,130 --> 00:02:58,950
Come on over here!

60
00:03:02,130 --> 00:03:02,970
Whoa!

61
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:05,270
They held such a grand event this year.

62
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,210
Must be tons of series to come.

63
00:03:06,290 --> 00:03:07,460
Think they'll be able to keep up?

64
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,170
Jeez, who could ever?

65
00:03:09,210 --> 00:03:11,260
No company could ever keep up with it.

66
00:03:11,970 --> 00:03:13,760
As long as my bias gets a series,
I'm fine with it.

67
00:03:14,770 --> 00:03:15,220
Alright,

68
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,310
the final pairing

69
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:18,010
that many have been waiting for

70
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,590
has arrived.

71
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:21,990
Excuse me,

72
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,260
allow me to use the chair.

73
00:03:23,770 --> 00:03:25,730
Get up there
and share the photos with me.

74
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:48,130
Please put your hands together
for Nine, Nopphanat Wongwiboon,

75
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:50,500
this year's 'Rising Star,'

76
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:53,110
the absolute man of the hour.

77
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:33,050
And of course,

78
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:34,280
wherever Nine is, there's Third,

79
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:35,790
Tharit Charatdecha,

80
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:38,370
who was awarded 'Best Supporting Actor'

81
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:40,510
and has second-to-none acting skills.

82
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:45,420
Together as 'Rising Star Partners,'

83
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:48,020
they are surely
a very promising pair to keep an eye on.

84
00:04:58,100 --> 00:05:01,840
And the series starring
Third and Nine as male leads is

85
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:04,580
'The Deep Between Us.'

86
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,480
Please make some noise once again!

87
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:27,130
- Hello, North.
- Hello.

88
00:05:27,150 --> 00:05:29,390
I heard this is your first series
as a producer.

89
00:05:29,410 --> 00:05:30,750
- As a new face,
- That's right.

90
00:05:30,780 --> 00:05:31,480
how do you feel?

91
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:33,360
I'm incredibly thrilled.

92
00:05:33,380 --> 00:05:35,220
- It's my first time doing this.
- Sure.

93
00:05:35,250 --> 00:05:36,390
It's very different from my acting career,

94
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:37,880
- Mm.
- but well... I'm sure that

95
00:05:37,909 --> 00:05:40,920
I'll do just as great a job
as I did when I was an actor.

96
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:42,750
One thing I must ask.

97
00:05:42,790 --> 00:05:43,159
Right.

98
00:05:43,190 --> 00:05:45,650
How did you manage
to get the rights to the novel?

99
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,840
I've heard that

100
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:48,700
the author felt really worried

101
00:05:48,730 --> 00:05:50,010
and didn't want it adapted into a series.

102
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,790
Yes.

103
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:53,690
It was a hard process

104
00:05:53,730 --> 00:05:54,980
to acquire the rights to this novel.

105
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,070
Absolutely no joke.

106
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:58,370
But I showed them how sincere I was

107
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,440
and assured them that

108
00:05:59,590 --> 00:06:00,910
we'd do everything

109
00:06:00,930 --> 00:06:02,180
- to the best of our ability.
- Mm... Right.

110
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:03,890
I guess they saw how determined we were.

111
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:05,910
As for our male leads,

112
00:06:05,930 --> 00:06:06,670
ThirdNine...

113
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:07,700
Third and Nine,

114
00:06:07,810 --> 00:06:08,600
how are you feeling?

115
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:10,610
How have you prepared
yourselves for this series?

116
00:06:11,430 --> 00:06:11,920
Right,

117
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:14,970
Copter is very determined
to become a competitive swimmer,

118
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:17,220
so I learned how to swim

119
00:06:17,250 --> 00:06:19,120
and studied
the character's feelings in depth

120
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,790
so I can convey them
as realistically as possible.

121
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:24,640
Right, I agree with Third,

122
00:06:24,670 --> 00:06:26,350
as we've done a heap of research.

123
00:06:26,370 --> 00:06:26,940
Also...

124
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:29,260
I'd like to express
how truly important everyone is.

125
00:06:29,380 --> 00:06:30,590
We're here today

126
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:32,420
because of all your support.

127
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,159
Right, Third?

128
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,200
Wow, do you see that? Do you?

129
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:39,400
That's a little too tight.

130
00:06:43,610 --> 00:06:44,670
Hey! Are you...

131
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:46,540
100% playing the part of Copter?!

132
00:06:46,750 --> 00:06:50,000
It's like they came straight
out of the novel cover or something.

133
00:06:50,030 --> 00:06:50,420
True that!

134
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:52,980
Besides, their skills are guaranteed by...

135
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,390
the 'Rising Star' award

136
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:56,659
and the 'Best Supporting Actor' award.

137
00:06:56,909 --> 00:06:58,120
With these accolades,

138
00:06:58,159 --> 00:07:00,120
how could they not be amazing?

139
00:07:00,150 --> 00:07:02,130
And you've formed
a joint venture with Da Xiang for this.

140
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,160
- Precisely.
- Right.

141
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,570
Uh, so this novel

142
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:06,000
has so many Thai fans

143
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,920
and international fans.

144
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:10,390
Therefore, Da Xiang
was interested in investing with us.

145
00:07:10,610 --> 00:07:13,520
So, I'm expecting
cute moments from this series.

146
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:14,860
Oh, rest assured.

147
00:07:14,890 --> 00:07:17,130
We'll certainly go all out.

148
00:07:17,390 --> 00:07:20,080
I'd prefer it
if everyone focuses on the acting

149
00:07:20,730 --> 00:07:23,110
since I believe that there are many factors...

150
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:25,160
that go into making a good series,

151
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:27,060
not just the cute moments alone.

152
00:07:31,730 --> 00:07:32,560
Right.

153
00:07:32,690 --> 00:07:33,390
We're looking forward to it.

154
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:34,420
Such an interesting series.

155
00:07:34,490 --> 00:07:36,200
Damn it, he's humiliating Nine!

156
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,320
But I think Third is right.

157
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:40,080
Nine was being too extra!

158
00:07:40,470 --> 00:07:42,500
Absolutely no one deserves Third, ever.

159
00:07:43,070 --> 00:07:43,780
I don't think so.

160
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:47,830
Your fave is incredibly lucky
to have Nine as his partner.

161
00:07:47,850 --> 00:07:49,200
Apart from acting,

162
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:50,620
he can sing and dance,

163
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:52,050
and he's an all-round Rising Star.

164
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,720
Plus... your fave

165
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,480
actually humiliated
someone mid-interview.

166
00:07:55,590 --> 00:07:56,440
Is that what a decent person does?

167
00:07:56,470 --> 00:07:57,520
And what's your problem?

168
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,880
I was just chatting with my girl

169
00:07:58,970 --> 00:08:00,400
when suddenly,
you stuck your nose in, acting all psycho

170
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:01,970
and even hyping up
your fave so desperately.

171
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:03,730
Take Nine's side or whatever.

172
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,150
As for me, I'm on Third's side!

173
00:08:06,190 --> 00:08:06,760
Right?

174
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:09,200
Dear fans!

175
00:08:09,230 --> 00:08:11,290
The merch has now been restocked.

176
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:12,960
