177
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:15,320
If it runs out, it runs out!

178
00:08:15,350 --> 00:08:16,920
Come on in!

179
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:17,860
Come on in, come on in.

180
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:18,890
Please.

181
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,340
How does that taste?

182
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:24,050
Whoa! This bitch!

183
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,090
Settle down.

184
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:27,710
- Settle down. You'll get a chance to...
- Whoa, calm down, ma'am.

185
00:08:27,750 --> 00:08:29,070
- Please settle down, guys.
- Please settle down.

186
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:32,020
- Everyone, settle down.
- You'll get your chance to claim it!

187
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,900
- Oh, thank you very much.
- Settle down, settle down,

188
00:08:33,940 --> 00:08:35,720
- Come, come, come.
- Stop!

189
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:38,650
Hello.

190
00:08:39,409 --> 00:08:41,210
I'd like two of each of Nine's merch items.

191
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,220
Would you also like Third's?

192
00:08:42,350 --> 00:08:42,980
No, thank you.

193
00:08:43,429 --> 00:08:43,880
Fabulous!

194
00:08:43,909 --> 00:08:45,480
A solo stan, not here for the pairing.

195
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,410
Rock it.

196
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,160
Are you Nine's fanboy?

197
00:08:48,190 --> 00:08:49,100
Isn't that cute?

198
00:08:49,140 --> 00:08:50,170
Uh...

199
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:51,430
It's for my friend.

200
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:52,700
- Right!
- Right!

201
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,580
- "It's for my friend."
- "It's for my friend."

202
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:57,100
So where's this friend of yours?

203
00:08:57,570 --> 00:08:58,160
Over there!

204
00:08:58,190 --> 00:08:58,920
There...

205
00:08:59,490 --> 00:09:00,770
- Over there, huh? Okay.
- Yes.

206
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,700
So that will be all?

207
00:09:01,730 --> 00:09:02,730
Okay, I'll take those off.

208
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:03,540
- Sure thing.
- Oh, okay.

209
00:09:03,570 --> 00:09:04,970
Two of each of Nine's merch items, yes?

210
00:09:05,010 --> 00:09:05,480
- Okay.
- Yes.

211
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:06,690
- Those in the back, please stay calm.
- Alright, all of Nine's merch.

212
00:09:06,730 --> 00:09:08,430
You'll get your chance to claim it.

213
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:09,200
Rest assured.

214
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,310
Please rest assured.

215
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:12,850
Jay, I'm dying to unbox it.

216
00:09:13,130 --> 00:09:14,390
Boy, you're way too obsessed!

217
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:16,940
Is it even worth it?

218
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,210
"Worth it" is an understatement.

219
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:22,940
And what's this?

220
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:23,640
Are you...

221
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,420
going to the gathering looking like that?

222
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,240
What's your deal?

223
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,520
I've brought a change of clothes.

224
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:32,190
What kind of person are you?

225
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,610
You seriously have a spare outfit?

226
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:34,460
Hey!

227
00:09:34,590 --> 00:09:35,700
I ride a motorcycle.

228
00:09:35,730 --> 00:09:36,570
When it rains,

229
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,730
I need my spare outfit
if I get soaked, don't I?

230
00:09:39,350 --> 00:09:40,740
Man, whatever.

231
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:42,320
I'll go see my sweet Pink.

232
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:43,540
Bye-bye.

233
00:09:43,610 --> 00:09:44,640
Getting my daily dose of Pink.

234
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:46,370
- Sure.
- My daily dose of Pink.

235
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:47,940
- Pink...
- Sure, go get your fill.

236
00:09:52,750 --> 00:09:54,160
Better go get changed.

237
00:10:24,650 --> 00:10:26,540
Where on earth is the restroom?

238
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:52,200
Third.

239
00:10:57,150 --> 00:11:01,850
Do I have to sign you up
for a Media Training 101 class?

240
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,340
What did I do wrong?

241
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,190
I said nothing but facts, didn't I?

242
00:11:06,350 --> 00:11:07,350
I'm here as an actor,

243
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:08,820
so acting is what I'm selling.

244
00:11:08,850 --> 00:11:11,470
You're selling both the "pairing"
and the "acting," boy.

245
00:11:13,290 --> 00:11:14,260
Besides,

246
00:11:14,290 --> 00:11:15,860
as you stand next to Nine,

247
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,430
you have to show him respect.

248
00:11:17,780 --> 00:11:18,780
You gave that interview

249
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:20,300
like you have
zero emotional intelligence.

250
00:11:20,470 --> 00:11:21,800
After how you reacted to Nine,

251
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:23,550
how are the fans gonna ship you now?

252
00:11:28,010 --> 00:11:29,570
If you'd like to stay in this industry...

253
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,740
you need to understand how it works.

254
00:11:32,230 --> 00:11:34,940
Don't get too big for your britches.

255
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,720
The label you're wearing

256
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,660
is "BL actor."

257
00:11:38,710 --> 00:11:39,990
But if you don't wanna do it,

258
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:41,520
all you have to do is retire

259
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:42,550
from the BL industry.

260
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,460
Just make sure...

261
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:47,560
your mom won't beat your ass.

262
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,280
That's enough.

263
00:11:56,370 --> 00:11:57,250
That's it.

264
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:15,960
Hey.

265
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:20,460
Don't stress it

266
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:23,770
because what you thought
was so damn cool

267
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,130
just landed us at No. 1 trending.

268
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:28,100
[#TheDeepSeries]
[#ThirdNine]

269
00:12:36,130 --> 00:12:37,180
Ooh...

270
00:12:38,060 --> 00:12:39,280
I really wanna unbox it!

271
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,660
Alright, I'll just do it.

272
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:55,760
[STAFF ONLY]

273
00:13:36,190 --> 00:13:37,760
[Nine]
[Special Box Set]

274
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:40,090
Oooh!

275
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:52,140
That's adorable.

276
00:13:53,380 --> 00:13:54,620
The insane quality, though...

277
00:13:55,010 --> 00:13:55,350
Ooh!

278
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,560
Shit...

279
00:13:58,820 --> 00:13:59,880
I spoke too soon.

280
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:20,860
Wan!

281
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:22,520
Where on earth are you changing clothes?

282
00:14:22,590 --> 00:14:24,270
Pink and I are already done
with the gathering.

283
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,260
Right,

284
00:14:25,290 --> 00:14:26,610
just stay with Pink for now.

285
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,640
I'm taking care of something.

286
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:29,280
What is it?

287
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:31,610
You changed and went
to unbox the thing, huh?

288
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:32,840
I knew you would!

289
00:14:33,660 --> 00:14:34,660
What do you mean?

290
00:14:34,700 --> 00:14:36,030
I have self-control.

291
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:36,980
Plus,

292
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,360
even if I did,

293
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:39,470
it's not like I did anything wrong!

294
00:14:39,990 --> 00:14:40,810
It is.

295
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,620
It's not!

296
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:51,960
It is,

297
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:54,160
since the fans can't access this area.

298
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:03,980
Sunny,

299
00:16:04,710 --> 00:16:05,750
send in the guards, please.

300
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,200
There's a stalking sasaeng in here.

301
00:16:33,950 --> 00:16:34,940
Hello, Wan.

302
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:36,420
Why did you hang up?

303
00:16:36,450 --> 00:16:38,040
Jay, help me!

304
00:16:38,210 --> 00:16:38,730
What was that?

305
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:39,390
Help you from what?

306
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:41,450
That damn Third called the guards on me!

307
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:43,250
Oh! So that's why he sounded familiar.

308
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:44,620
Stop thinking about it and help me!

309
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:45,830
I'm in here somewhere!

310
00:16:45,860 --> 00:16:47,240
You need to find a way in.

311
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:52,690
Am I the only one here or something?!

312
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:54,270
Where in the hell are all the guards?!

313
00:17:06,619 --> 00:17:07,740
Susan,

314
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:09,500
please give Nine a touch-up.

315
00:17:28,450 --> 00:17:29,410
Nine...

316
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:35,120
Who are you?!

317
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:36,860
A sasaeng.

318
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:39,000
A sasaeng...

319
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,590
You stalking sasaeng...

320
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:43,020
Whoa!

321
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:43,920
Who the hell is this?!

322
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:45,280
- A fucking sasaeng, bitch!
- A fucking sasaeng, bitch!

323
00:17:45,310 --> 00:17:46,590
- Huh? A sasaeng?!
- A sasaeng!

324
00:17:47,630 --> 00:17:48,110
Susan!

325
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:48,780
- Catch...
- Argh!

326
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:49,310
Argh!

327
00:17:49,330 --> 00:17:50,030
Ah!

328
00:17:50,070 --> 00:17:51,280
- Argh! You sasaeng.
- Ugh!

329
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,380
A sasaeng?

330
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:53,760
- Go to that end!
- Catch him!

331
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:54,960
- Get him!
- Rotate it.

332
00:17:55,210 --> 00:17:55,840
Arghh!

333
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:57,370
I got him! I got him!

334
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,400
No, you got me!

335
00:17:58,470 --> 00:17:59,220
He's over there!

336
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:01,820
Rin!

337
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:03,080
- Huh?
- Come help!

338
00:18:03,110 --> 00:18:04,050
Bitch!

339
00:18:04,430 --> 00:18:05,620
Gotcha, you fucking sasaeng!

340
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,190
- That's my neck!
- Ugh!

341
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,360
- Grab onto the rack!
- Uh, my bad.

342
00:18:08,410 --> 00:18:09,640
- Yeah!
- You sasaeng...

343
00:18:09,670 --> 00:18:10,720
Why are you so fucking strong?!

344
00:18:11,870 --> 00:18:13,640
He's rotating it!

345
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:14,910
I'm getting dizzy, ugh!

346
00:18:14,950 --> 00:18:16,270
- Three, two, one!
- Three, two, one!

347
00:18:17,470 --> 00:18:18,390
Where are you going?!

348
00:18:18,430 --> 00:18:19,680
You think you could get away from me?!

349
00:18:19,710 --> 00:18:20,520
Nab him...

350
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:21,200
How did you get in here?

351
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:23,750
Is everything okay?

352
00:18:25,050 --> 00:18:26,320
The cavalry finally arrives.

353
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:27,630
Jeez... Took you long enough.

354
00:18:27,730 --> 00:18:29,180
Take him!

355
00:18:29,490 --> 00:18:30,380
Get him good.

356
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,190
People like this

357
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,440
don't belong in society!

358
00:18:32,490 --> 00:18:33,690
Sir, take him away.

359
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:34,330
Rin,

360
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:35,230
- Huh?
- Susan,

361
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:36,190
stay here with Nine.

362
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,170
I'll deal with him.

363
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,020
Sure, sure, sure.

364
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:38,970
Go make sure he's dealt with.

365
00:18:39,010 --> 00:18:39,840
These damn people...

366
00:18:40,020 --> 00:18:40,710
Hey!

367
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:41,650
What's a sasaeng?

368
00:18:43,050 --> 00:18:45,240
Sir, you've got it all wrong!

369
00:19:08,130 --> 00:19:09,240
Third,

370
00:19:09,420 --> 00:19:10,460
go wait in the room.

371
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:12,080
I'll take care of that stalking sasaeng.

372
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:13,830
He'll get a piece of me.

373
00:19:13,870 --> 00:19:14,580
Grab me.

374
00:19:16,170 --> 00:19:16,800
Ugh...

375
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:19,620
Now, go.

376
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,270
Off you go.

377
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,440
Wasn't that too far?

378
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:31,560
You two, turn him over to the cops.

379
00:19:33,430 --> 00:19:34,610
I'm not a stalking sasaeng.

380
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:37,300
You're not...

381
00:19:37,750 --> 00:19:38,440
Then what is that?

382
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:43,880
The merch... is for
my proxy shopping service.

383
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:45,070
As for the chair,

384
00:19:45,090 --> 00:19:46,230
I'm a photographer for hire.

385
00:19:46,670 --> 00:19:48,080
Whoa!

386
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:49,400
What are you doing to my friends?

387
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:51,680
Dude...

388
00:19:51,910 --> 00:19:53,160
They're saying I'm a sasaeng.

389
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:57,960
Why did you become a sasaeng?

390
00:19:58,020 --> 00:19:59,020
Jay, you bastard!

391
00:19:59,200 --> 00:19:59,870
Be serious!

392
00:20:02,850 --> 00:20:03,760
Uh...

393
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:06,450
What proof do you have
to accuse him of being a stalking sasaeng?

394
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:07,600
True, true, true.

395
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:10,320
Your friend snuck into
the artist's dressing room, that's what.

396
00:20:13,930 --> 00:20:15,260
Jeez... So what?

397
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:16,430
He just entered the wrong room.

398
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:17,930
How does that make him a sasaeng?

399
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,040
Where's the proof?

400
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:20,580
Mm, where?

401
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,150
There it is,

402
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:25,000
the complete and blatant proof
that you're a stalking sasaeng.

403
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,080
What?!

404
00:20:26,310 --> 00:20:27,400
Are you just accusing him now?!

405
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,720
Anyone can buy merch, can't they?

406
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:31,210
I'm a paying customer.

407
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:32,470
You should thank me.

408
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:33,170
Sir!

409
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:36,020
Are you gonna believe
this dragon lady or me?

410
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:37,870
Don't listen to them.

411
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:39,210
Hand them over to the cops.

412
00:20:39,450 --> 00:20:40,450
Whoa, whoa, whoa...

413
00:20:40,730 --> 00:20:42,770
Ooh... should I go live?

414
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:45,560
This way, the whole world will know that,

415
00:20:45,750 --> 00:20:47,250
in management's eyes,

416
00:20:47,350 --> 00:20:49,690
the fans are at the bottom of the system.

417
00:20:49,710 --> 00:20:52,590
It's gonna blow up so hard
it'll knock #TheDeepSeries to the bottom.

418
00:20:52,890 --> 00:20:54,760
I think the world deserves to know.

419
00:20:54,800 --> 00:20:55,870
Go on!

420
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:56,760
Take us away!

421
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:57,840
I'm gonna scream!

422
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,240
Loudly, by the way!

423
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:01,130
Yeah, tell them being a fan is wrong!

424
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:01,840
True!

425
00:21:01,870 --> 00:21:02,960
That buying merch is wrong!

426
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:03,830
Exactly!

427
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:05,790
Still, you're desperate
for the fans' support.

428
00:21:05,810 --> 00:21:07,210
Yeah, I'm so confused.

429
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:08,730
It's basically free labor!

430
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:10,210
Ooh, so what now?

431
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,740
What are you gonna do?!

432
00:21:11,780 --> 00:21:12,940
Ugh!

433
00:21:13,310 --> 00:21:15,040
I don't wanna make it a big deal
and ruin a good day.

434
00:21:15,280 --> 00:21:17,600
Just don't show
your faces around me again.

435
00:21:17,890 --> 00:21:19,160
Next time,

436
00:21:19,190 --> 00:21:20,400
I'll be the one going live!

437
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:22,610
You're not gonna be the ones who get to do it.

438
00:21:23,690 --> 00:21:24,690
Please get them outta here.

439
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:26,840
Hey...

440
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:29,000
We can walk.

441
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:31,700
We'll strut out in style.

442
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,320
Is my merch damaged?

443
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,440
If it is, just pre-order another one.

444
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:07,660
"Pre-order," do you even hear yourself?

445
00:22:08,150 --> 00:22:09,440
That's gonna take a lifetime.

446
00:22:09,570 --> 00:22:11,940
Jeez... they've improved
the system nowadays.

447
00:22:12,150 --> 00:22:14,160
Sometimes, it depends on
the manufacturer, too.

448
00:22:14,390 --> 00:22:15,560
Give them a chance.

449
00:22:15,620 --> 00:22:17,170
It's not gonna take a couple of days.

450
00:22:17,430 --> 00:22:18,430
So...

451
00:22:18,460 --> 00:22:19,410
what happened?

452
00:22:19,450 --> 00:22:20,250
Fill me in.

453
00:22:20,860 --> 00:22:22,040
I'm not ready to!

454
00:22:24,590 --> 00:22:25,470
Jay?

455
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:31,350
So this dude snuck off
to unbox his merch on the rooftop,

456
00:22:31,380 --> 00:22:31,960
came across Third,

457
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:34,240
ran into Nine's room,
and taken away as a stalking sasaeng

458
00:22:34,280 --> 00:22:35,060
by the guards Third called.

459
00:22:35,100 --> 00:22:36,630
Sir, you've got it all wrong!

460
00:22:37,390 --> 00:22:38,850
My dear angelic boy,

461
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:40,180
what a good person you are.

462
00:22:41,210 --> 00:22:41,940
And you...

463
00:22:41,970 --> 00:22:43,200
Why did you become a sasaeng?

464
00:22:43,540 --> 00:22:44,600
You've taken it too damn far.

465
00:22:45,010 --> 00:22:45,470
I'm!

466
00:22:45,510 --> 00:22:45,930
Not!

467
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:46,480
A!

468
00:22:46,510 --> 00:22:47,040
Fucking...

469
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:51,210
Sasaeng!!

470
00:22:51,250 --> 00:22:52,940
Ugh... You jerk!

471
00:22:53,050 --> 00:22:54,260
I'm going home.

472
00:22:54,870 --> 00:22:56,490
View, take care of your older brother.

473
00:23:02,770 --> 00:23:03,770
Wan.

474
00:23:07,310 --> 00:23:08,040
Wan?

475
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:13,710
Wan!

476
00:23:13,730 --> 00:23:16,640
[The Deep Between Us]

477
00:23:19,900 --> 00:23:20,970
I'll trade it for Third's photos.

478
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,370
I know you got some shots of him.

479
00:23:25,170 --> 00:23:27,150
Do you want it or not?

480
00:23:27,890 --> 00:23:29,150
I only have one.

481
00:23:31,540 --> 00:23:32,310
Send it over.

482
00:23:34,310 --> 00:23:35,310
Ooh!

483
00:23:35,510 --> 00:23:37,080
Stunning!

484
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:39,230
He's both talented and handsome.

485
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:40,790
You're good at taking photos.
I'll give you that.

486
00:24:18,080 --> 00:24:20,590
[Trending]
[#TheDeepSeries]

487
00:24:20,630 --> 00:24:22,630
♫Baby, feel the drive♫

488
00:24:22,670 --> 00:24:24,710
♫The thrill hittin' right♫

489
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:26,870
♫Let's go for a ride♫

490
00:24:26,890 --> 00:24:28,890
♫Here we go, here we go,
chitty-chitty, clang-clang♫

491
00:24:28,910 --> 00:24:30,670
[Casting Call]

492
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:37,630
♫Here we go, here we go,
chitty-chitty, clang-clang♫

493
00:24:37,670 --> 00:24:39,670
♫Oh, clang-clang♫

494
00:24:40,250 --> 00:24:42,020
♫Down with the beat,
deeper we go!♫

495
00:24:42,050 --> 00:24:44,200
♫Yeah, yeah, yeah,
yeah, yeah, yeah♫

496
00:24:44,230 --> 00:24:46,400
♫Here we go, here we go,
chitty-chitty, clang-clang♫

497
00:25:02,300 --> 00:25:04,650
I called Pitch to discuss
yesterday's incident

498
00:25:12,180 --> 00:25:13,830
and have already hired a PR team.

499
00:25:13,910 --> 00:25:15,760
Had we waited for you to make your move,

500
00:25:16,360 --> 00:25:17,770
you wouldn't be able
to do it if you tried.

501
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,280
Do whatever you want, Mom.

502
00:25:23,990 --> 00:25:24,720
Good.

503
00:25:25,830 --> 00:25:28,110
Since you've realized
that you're incapable,

504
00:25:28,670 --> 00:25:29,760
letting me take care of it

505
00:25:29,790 --> 00:25:30,990
is the right call.

506
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:38,180
Just fulfill your duty properly.

507
00:25:39,010 --> 00:25:40,390
I sincerely hope that

508
00:25:40,810 --> 00:25:42,170
you can manage that much

509
00:25:42,380 --> 00:25:43,670
on your own for once

510
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:46,270
because if you
keep making mistakes,

511
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:52,080
I won't be able to be...

512
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:54,870
so nice to you anymore.

513
00:26:09,830 --> 00:26:11,890
[I was too in character yesterday
probably because Noel was next to me;

514
00:26:11,910 --> 00:26:13,950
please stay tuned to see us
in 'The Deep Between Us']

515
00:26:18,190 --> 00:26:18,950
Wan!

516
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:19,680
What the heck?

517
00:26:19,750 --> 00:26:21,030
Why are you in my room?

518
00:26:21,370 --> 00:26:22,370
Look.

519
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:34,560
Hey, where are you going?

520
00:26:35,820 --> 00:26:36,960
Home. Move!

521
00:26:37,280 --> 00:26:38,630
Wait, wait, wait.

522
00:26:38,660 --> 00:26:40,270
You can't just ride
a motorcycle to Ayutthaya.

523
00:26:40,300 --> 00:26:41,860
Some ten-wheel truck
is gonna run you over!

524
00:26:42,080 --> 00:26:43,870
- Get a grip and call Mom first, will you?
- Why bother?

525
00:26:43,910 --> 00:26:45,230
No need to call
when the entire shop is in ruins.

526
00:26:45,270 --> 00:26:46,270
No, stop!

527
00:26:46,440 --> 00:26:47,960
Can you just get a grip?

528
00:26:47,990 --> 00:26:49,200
You're not thinking straight,

529
00:26:49,230 --> 00:26:50,310
so how could that help anyone?

530
00:26:50,810 --> 00:26:51,580
Give me that.

531
00:26:52,790 --> 00:26:53,570
Go.

532
00:26:54,930 --> 00:26:55,800
It's nothing, kids.
[Mom]

533
00:26:55,820 --> 00:26:58,100
Don't worry. I'll take care of it.

534
00:26:58,890 --> 00:27:00,510
Aunt Paed has already sent me photos

535
00:27:00,570 --> 00:27:01,570
of our house in ruins.

536
00:27:03,260 --> 00:27:04,030
Aunt Paed...

537
00:27:04,420 --> 00:27:06,310
She's a master of
sticking her nose in, huh?

538
00:27:08,970 --> 00:27:10,480
I...

539
00:27:11,130 --> 00:27:13,070
fell for a call-center scam.

540
00:27:13,100 --> 00:27:13,870
Huh?!

541
00:27:15,220 --> 00:27:17,660
It was that day when I called you, Wan,

542
00:27:17,870 --> 00:27:18,470
asking...

543
00:27:18,510 --> 00:27:19,470
if the money was enough,

544
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:20,970
and you seemed confused.

545
00:27:21,010 --> 00:27:22,370
I remember that day.

546
00:27:22,630 --> 00:27:23,620
But I already told you

547
00:27:23,650 --> 00:27:25,580
that I wasn't in need!

548
00:27:25,610 --> 00:27:26,770
Exactly.

549
00:27:26,870 --> 00:27:28,880
That's how I found out I'd been scammed.

550
00:27:29,990 --> 00:27:30,700
So...

551
00:27:31,050 --> 00:27:32,360
Why didn't you check

552
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:34,110
if the name on
