00:39:36,430 --> 00:39:37,480
the role of "Sky."

839
00:39:37,850 --> 00:39:40,530
You're straight
out of the description, sweetie!

840
00:39:41,210 --> 00:39:43,960
Ma'am, there's one spot
he forgot to fill out.

841
00:39:43,980 --> 00:39:45,060
It's... his agency.

842
00:39:45,530 --> 00:39:46,560
- Oh...
- Does he have one?

843
00:39:46,590 --> 00:39:48,400
It's 'Our Houses.' He's with Wut.

844
00:39:49,590 --> 00:39:51,030
It's better to have a home.

845
00:39:51,220 --> 00:39:52,190
It's more comforting that way.

846
00:39:52,470 --> 00:39:53,310
Trust me.

847
00:39:53,440 --> 00:39:54,520
Fabulous, sis.

848
00:39:54,550 --> 00:39:55,950
If you hadn't been with one,

849
00:39:55,980 --> 00:39:57,750
I would've started my own agency.

850
00:39:57,850 --> 00:39:58,710
Where have you been

851
00:39:58,730 --> 00:40:00,040
all our lives, hiding that look, sweetie?

852
00:40:00,130 --> 00:40:01,940
Here's an audition script

853
00:40:01,980 --> 00:40:03,400
for Sky, sweetie.

854
00:40:03,430 --> 00:40:04,210
- Sure thing.
- Alright...

855
00:40:04,240 --> 00:40:05,670
The role is definitely his.

856
00:40:05,700 --> 00:40:06,970
He's perfect for the description.

857
00:40:07,280 --> 00:40:08,840
- Thank her.
- You've got this.

858
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:09,810
Let's go.

859
00:40:09,830 --> 00:40:10,690
Say thank you to the nice lady.

860
00:40:10,720 --> 00:40:12,370
- Uh... thank you.
- Thank you.

861
00:40:12,390 --> 00:40:13,090
- Let's go.
- Bye-bye.

862
00:40:13,110 --> 00:40:14,600
Best of luck. Bye-bye.

863
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:16,270
- Bye-bye.
- Alright.

864
00:40:16,380 --> 00:40:18,670
Let's do a bit more touch-up
on your face and your hair, shall we?

865
00:40:19,680 --> 00:40:21,350
- He's gonna land the role of Sky.
- For sure.

866
00:40:21,490 --> 00:40:22,060
Thank you.

867
00:40:22,090 --> 00:40:24,250
- Bye-bye.
- Thank you.

868
00:40:26,370 --> 00:40:27,220
Alright, one down.

869
00:40:27,690 --> 00:40:29,120
- It's Time, right?
- It is.

870
00:40:29,410 --> 00:40:30,480
Right now, it's no one else but Time.

871
00:40:30,520 --> 00:40:31,730
Only Time.

872
00:40:32,210 --> 00:40:34,060
- Obviously.
- True.

873
00:40:34,090 --> 00:40:35,290
Here, let's go ahead and mark him.

874
00:40:35,330 --> 00:40:36,370
Drawing an asterisk.

875
00:40:38,910 --> 00:40:39,620
We'll go with Renji.

876
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:40,680
- Huh?
- Huh?

877
00:40:43,080 --> 00:40:43,520
Huh?

878
00:40:44,040 --> 00:40:45,170
Did you get the name wrong?

879
00:40:45,700 --> 00:40:46,490
Him.

880
00:40:46,670 --> 00:40:48,170
Oh, no, no, no, no.

881
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:49,400
He's right.

882
00:40:49,640 --> 00:40:50,410
It's Renji.

883
00:40:50,520 --> 00:40:50,960
Hey?

884
00:40:51,650 --> 00:40:52,510
Hey.

885
00:40:52,780 --> 00:40:53,380
By the look of him,

886
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:55,300
it's like he glided right off the novel cover.

887
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:57,430
I mean, Time is alright,

888
00:40:57,470 --> 00:40:58,890
but Renji looks the part.

889
00:40:59,130 --> 00:41:00,920
As for the acting, no sweat.

890
00:41:00,950 --> 00:41:02,360
Leave it to me

891
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:03,770
- Mm-hm.
- because it's my job.

892
00:41:04,170 --> 00:41:06,780
Okay, then.
I'm really relying on you for this.

893
00:41:06,900 --> 00:41:08,360
Didn't seem like his acting was any good.

894
00:41:08,390 --> 00:41:09,060
Ugh...

895
00:41:09,100 --> 00:41:12,070
People learn through trial and error,

896
00:41:12,100 --> 00:41:15,020
so make sure you give him directions.

897
00:41:15,160 --> 00:41:17,360
But count on me.
I'll make sure he performs well.

898
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:20,050
Sure, just do your best with your part.

899
00:41:20,150 --> 00:41:22,740
There's one person left
auditioning for Sky.

900
00:41:22,860 --> 00:41:23,850
Please come in.

901
00:41:24,420 --> 00:41:25,670
And you are...

902
00:41:25,850 --> 00:41:27,440
Wan, right?

903
00:41:27,820 --> 00:41:28,580
Yes.

904
00:41:39,280 --> 00:41:40,330
Focus.

905
00:41:40,550 --> 00:41:41,340
No rush.

906
00:41:41,810 --> 00:41:43,390
Whenever you're ready, though.

907
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:47,440
[Wan]

908
00:41:52,610 --> 00:41:55,600
"Huh... So this is the promising young shark?"

909
00:42:02,370 --> 00:42:03,340
"Huh... Is this

910
00:42:03,360 --> 00:42:05,600
the promising young shark
Coach praises so much?"

911
00:42:05,720 --> 00:42:07,910
All I can see is a fucking loser.

912
00:42:07,950 --> 00:42:09,600
Why? Can't handle some sting?

913
00:42:09,690 --> 00:42:10,370
"What?

914
00:42:11,300 --> 00:42:13,000
Why are you staring at me? Are you angry?

915
00:42:16,740 --> 00:42:17,940
Or you can't handle the truth I said?"

916
00:42:17,990 --> 00:42:18,670
Terrible.

917
00:42:19,170 --> 00:42:21,290
What me to show you superior acting?

918
00:42:27,290 --> 00:42:28,660
Show me how it's done

919
00:42:29,080 --> 00:42:30,170
since you're so good.

920
00:42:31,720 --> 00:42:34,430
From what I've seen
in the series, you're not all that.

921
00:42:39,250 --> 00:42:40,200
Come on.

922
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:45,280
Fine.

923
00:42:48,890 --> 00:42:50,320
Run the scene with me, then.

924
00:42:53,850 --> 00:42:55,580
But you'll have to improvise it.

925
00:42:58,070 --> 00:42:59,160
You first.

926
00:42:59,310 --> 00:43:00,230
I'm giving you a head start.

927
00:43:06,890 --> 00:43:07,690
Go ahead.

928
00:43:13,250 --> 00:43:14,910
You think you're so good.

929
00:43:15,640 --> 00:43:17,530
Are you sure
you made it here because of your skills?

930
00:43:21,060 --> 00:43:24,090
I think, just maybe,
it's your family pulling some strings?

931
00:43:24,640 --> 00:43:26,290
That's why you're here.

932
00:43:30,590 --> 00:43:32,480
You're absolutely not a good match
for your partner.

933
00:43:34,110 --> 00:43:36,370
And why do you think
I'm not a good match for him?

934
00:43:37,120 --> 00:43:38,880
At least, I never have
to go to desperate lengths

935
00:43:39,490 --> 00:43:41,250
just to approach someone.

936
00:43:42,090 --> 00:43:44,040
But I can see you're already busting a gut

937
00:43:44,570 --> 00:43:45,670
just to be seen by someone,

938
00:43:46,610 --> 00:43:48,080
just to impress them.

939
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:50,400
But let me tell you something.

940
00:43:50,820 --> 00:43:53,090
You have a shitty way of doing it!

941
00:43:53,110 --> 00:43:54,150
How is it shitty?

942
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:55,490
I'm just here to audition.

943
00:43:55,670 --> 00:43:57,190
- If you don't know a thing...
- Do I really have to know?

944
00:43:59,150 --> 00:44:00,250
You wouldn't understand.

945
00:44:00,270 --> 00:44:01,300
You're playing dumb.

946
00:44:01,930 --> 00:44:03,670
Did you come up with that yourself,
or was it your family?

947
00:44:03,710 --> 00:44:04,340
Hm?

948
00:44:05,490 --> 00:44:07,080
Go home and ask your family

949
00:44:08,790 --> 00:44:10,480
how the fuck they raised you...

950
00:44:11,310 --> 00:44:12,770
to be so deceitful.

951
00:44:15,080 --> 00:44:16,210
Keep your mouth off my family.

952
00:44:16,240 --> 00:44:17,590
You did that to mine first.

953
00:44:18,480 --> 00:44:20,840
If you wouldn't like it done to you,

954
00:44:21,000 --> 00:44:22,440
maybe don't do it to someone else,

955
00:44:22,850 --> 00:44:24,150
or people might say...

956
00:44:24,190 --> 00:44:26,340
that your family is incapable.

957
00:44:26,370 --> 00:44:28,490
If you're saying,
"my family helps with everything,"

958
00:44:28,520 --> 00:44:31,930
then that means
your family hasn't helped shit!

959
00:44:41,830 --> 00:44:42,310
Oh, gosh!

960
00:44:45,410 --> 00:44:46,180
Why?

961
00:44:46,310 --> 00:44:47,470
Oh, my God.

962
00:44:49,050 --> 00:44:49,880
Yeah!

963
00:44:50,030 --> 00:44:51,520
My family is not doing well.

964
00:44:51,870 --> 00:44:53,060
We're always in trouble.

965
00:44:53,290 --> 00:44:55,520
You have no idea
what the fuck I've been through.

966
00:44:55,720 --> 00:44:56,840
You have no idea how hard I've tried

967
00:44:56,880 --> 00:44:58,280
to give my family a better life.

968
00:44:58,490 --> 00:44:59,590
You were born rich!

969
00:45:00,080 --> 00:45:01,080
What the fuck would you know?

970
00:45:01,270 --> 00:45:02,440
In your mind,

971
00:45:02,570 --> 00:45:03,880
you're so perfect!

972
00:45:03,960 --> 00:45:05,080
You're the best!

973
00:45:05,190 --> 00:45:06,380
No one's better than you!

974
00:45:06,690 --> 00:45:07,770
Be careful, though.

975
00:45:07,940 --> 00:45:09,720
With that fucking nature and sharp tongue,

976
00:45:09,750 --> 00:45:10,840
your glory days might not last long.

977
00:45:10,930 --> 00:45:12,250
But you have nothing to worry about, huh?!

978
00:45:12,290 --> 00:45:13,640
Your family is well-off, anyway.

979
00:45:13,790 --> 00:45:16,790
You seem to know everything about me.

980
00:45:18,370 --> 00:45:19,440
Are you a fan?

981
00:45:20,710 --> 00:45:21,420
Hm?

982
00:45:24,370 --> 00:45:26,470
All this effort...

983
00:45:27,080 --> 00:45:28,690
Is it to get a sneak peek at the celebs?

984
00:45:30,020 --> 00:45:31,310
Are you my fan?

985
00:45:33,260 --> 00:45:34,260
Or Nine's?

986
00:45:38,660 --> 00:45:40,100
Watch your behavior, though,

987
00:45:40,830 --> 00:45:43,190
or people will call you
a "stalking sasaeng."

988
00:45:45,530 --> 00:45:46,400
What now?

989
00:45:47,760 --> 00:45:50,380
Do you want me to tell everyone
who you really are?

990
00:45:57,060 --> 00:45:58,670
I recognize you...

991
00:46:01,860 --> 00:46:03,340
Why did you become a sasaeng?

992
00:46:03,380 --> 00:46:04,700
- You've taken it too damn far.
- I'm!

993
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:05,380
Not!

994
00:46:05,410 --> 00:46:06,180
A!

995
00:46:06,200 --> 00:46:06,780
Fucking...

996
00:46:06,800 --> 00:46:09,280
Sasaeng!!

997
00:46:18,410 --> 00:46:19,880
Hey, Luang. Go check on Wan.

998
00:46:20,270 --> 00:46:20,850
Right.

999
00:46:20,870 --> 00:46:22,030
No, no, Luang...

1000
00:46:22,060 --> 00:46:22,970
