1002
00:46:27,170 --> 00:46:28,480
I think you took it a bit too far.

1003
00:46:28,820 --> 00:46:30,960
What if it got out
and did a number on the series?

1004
00:46:35,390 --> 00:46:37,650
That was so impulsive, though.

1005
00:46:40,600 --> 00:46:40,980
- Hey...
- I mean...

1006
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:42,180
Alright, come whisper it to me.

1007
00:46:42,200 --> 00:46:43,650
That's what we do for private stuff.

1008
00:46:44,340 --> 00:46:46,320
Wan, the boy who just auditioned for Sky...

1009
00:46:46,340 --> 00:46:48,260
I mean, it'll work, but...

1010
00:46:48,320 --> 00:46:50,140
- I'll have a hard time directing.
- So lit.

1011
00:46:53,830 --> 00:46:54,260
Wan!

1012
