1020
00:47:27,270 --> 00:47:29,090
Do you want me to tell everyone
who you really are?

1021
00:47:29,120 --> 00:47:29,640
Who are you?

1022
00:47:29,870 --> 00:47:30,590
A sasaeng.

1023
00:47:31,600 --> 00:47:32,450
You were born rich!

1024
