1089
00:50:46,230 --> 00:50:51,110
[The Deep Between Us]

1090
00:51:11,160 --> 00:51:11,820
Wan.

1091
00:51:11,840 --> 00:51:13,720
Jay, why are you here?

1092
00:51:13,820 --> 00:51:14,820
Where's Wan?

1093
00:51:15,240 --> 00:51:15,910
In his room.

1094
00:51:15,930 --> 00:51:17,520
Why did you bring dog food, though?

1095
00:51:17,570 --> 00:51:18,930
- Just in case it's a fluke.
- Huh?

1096
00:51:19,000 --> 00:51:20,380
Go in. The door isn't locked.

1097
00:51:22,740 --> 00:51:23,990
Wan! Wake up, man.

1098
00:51:24,850 --> 00:51:25,570
Wake up!

1099
00:51:26,060 --> 00:51:27,170
What?

1100
00:51:27,420 --> 00:51:28,810
Someone called.

1101
00:51:29,020 --> 00:51:29,970
Give them a call back.

1102
00:51:30,900 --> 00:51:31,730
Why hand me your phone?

1103
00:51:31,760 --> 00:51:33,270
It's yours, not mine.

1104
00:51:34,700 --> 00:51:36,120
Cher called.

1105
00:51:36,880 --> 00:51:37,460
What?

1106
00:51:37,580 --> 00:51:39,110
But why did she call you?

1107
00:51:40,190 --> 00:51:41,630
He gave her my number, that's what.

1108
00:51:41,870 --> 00:51:42,470
Here.

1109
00:51:48,740 --> 00:51:49,680
Hello?

1110
00:51:50,180 --> 00:51:51,700
Is this really you, Wan?

1111
00:51:51,980 --> 00:51:52,700
Yes.

1112
00:52:02,530 --> 00:52:03,410
So what's up?

1113
00:52:20,610 --> 00:52:22,370
Shit, you made the cut?!

1114
00:52:22,530 --> 00:52:23,710
Made what cut?

1115
00:52:23,750 --> 00:52:26,880
Well, he auditioned for
a series called 'The Deep Between Us.'

1116
00:52:26,970 --> 00:52:27,780
The one...

1117
